<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 78-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V WESTERN PROVINCE - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 78-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V WESTERN PROVINCE - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, 178 runs ahead of</p>
<p>Western Province on first innings, were 78 for four in their</p>
<p>second innings at the close on the second day of the three-day</p>
<p>match at Newlands on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 439-4 declared and 78-4. Western Province:</p>
<p>261-5 declared.</p>
</text>
